<title>USA: Lauderdale Cty, Miss., won by Duncan Williams.</title>
<headline>Lauderdale Cty, Miss., won by Duncan Williams.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duncan Williams said it won $5.200 million of Lauderdale Cty, Miss., general obligation road and bridge bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 4.88 percent.</p>
</text>
